message: "If you use this plugin, please cite it as below."
title: "voro-qgis-teryt-qa: QGIS plugin for quality checks of Polish municipality boundaries (PRG) against TERC"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ruszczak
    given-names: Marcin
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-0170-4277"
    affiliation: Independent
version: 0.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23578393
date-released: 2026-10-22
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/MR73BIIO/voro-qgis-teryt-qa"
abstract: >-
  QGIS Processing plugin that checks municipality polygons from the Polish
  register of boundaries (PRG) against county polygons and the TERC register:
  geometry, TERYT codes, nesting in counties, CRS and extent, overlaps and gaps,
  names. Rules and thresholds come from voro-gis-qa; the plugin gives the same
  findings on its test data.
